docs/workflow-format.md:82:- `pre_actions` is kept only on `api_request` and `code` nodes (and the other non-conversation action types).
docs/workflow-format.md:84:So a node cannot have both. If a call must run before a conversation node, put it in its own `api_request` node in front.
